# The build context for ci/images/rust.Dockerfile, and only for it: BuildKit reads
# the ignore file named after the Dockerfile in preference to the root one.
#
# An allowlist, so that only the ~230 kB slice the Dockerfile's COPYs read
# reaches the builder, and so that a change anywhere else in the checkout never
# invalidates the 3.4 GB toolchain layer it feeds. It is the same slice
# .devcontainer/ubuntu.dockerfile.dockerignore admits, less the devcontainer's
# own scripts, and it follows the same rule: A RE-INCLUSION NEVER CARRIES A
# WILDCARD, because one `*` in a `!` pattern makes BuildKit's context sender walk
# the whole working tree before a byte moves. scripts/ci/build-context.sh fails
# when a tracked file in one of the enumerated families below is missing here.
*

# The test runner's installer, run on its own before the gg slice.
!/scripts/ci/install-nextest.sh

# The gg toolchain installers, enumerated, plus the two files every one of them
# sources. install-nextest.sh above is matched by the Dockerfile's `install-*.sh`
# COPY as well.
!/scripts/ci/install-adapter.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-dotnet.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-gg-build-toolchains.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-gg-build-tools.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-gg-toolchains.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-java.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-kotlin.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-purescript.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-rust-wasm.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-swift.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-uv.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-wasi-sdk.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-wit-bindgen.sh
!/scripts/ci/lib.sh
!/scripts/ci/fetch.sh

# gg's shared build shell, which those installers source.
!/scripts/gg-arms.sh
!/scripts/gg-artifacts-out-dir.sh
!/scripts/gg-artifacts.sh
!/scripts/gg-downloads.sh
!/scripts/gg-npm-tools.sh
!/scripts/gg-probe-fixtures.sh
!/scripts/gg-reference.sh
!/scripts/gg-scratch-lock.sh
!/scripts/gg-signatures.sh

# Every arm's version file, and nothing else under packages/, which is why the
# Dockerfile can COPY `packages` as a directory.
!/packages/gg-sandbox-cpp/cpp-version.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-csharp/csharp-version.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-java/java-version.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-kotlin/kotlin-version.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-purescript/purescript-version.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-ruby/opal-version.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-ruby/yard-version.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-rust/rust-version.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-swift/swift-version.sh

# The nine inputs scripts/ci/install-gg-build-tools.sh warms the
# package-manager-delivered half of gg's build toolchain from: the two build.sh
# that carry a componentize pin, the Python arm's wheels, the Rust arm's and the
# guest's separate lockfiles, and the PureScript arm's package set and lock.
!/packages/gg-sandbox/build.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-python/build.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-python/requirements.txt
!/packages/gg-sandbox-rust/Cargo.toml
!/packages/gg-sandbox-rust/Cargo.lock
!/packages/gg-sandbox/guest/Cargo.toml
!/packages/gg-sandbox/guest/Cargo.lock
!/packages/gg-sandbox-purescript/spago.yaml
!/packages/gg-sandbox-purescript/spago.lock

# The Rust arm's pin defers to the workspace's channel.
!/rust-toolchain.toml

# macOS Finder metadata, which would otherwise ride in under `packages`.
**/.DS_Store
